@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> PatchInterpreting : interpret_patch()
Idle --> ReportInterpreting : interpret_saved_report()
PatchInterpreting --> EfficientNetPass : expert interpreter available
PatchInterpreting --> GNNPass : GNN interpreter available
ReportInterpreting --> EfficientNetPass : expert attribution required
ReportInterpreting --> GNNPass : spatial attribution required
EfficientNetPass --> MergeResults
GNNPass --> MergeResults
MergeResults --> Returned
Returned --> Idle
@enduml
